                                                "sense_id": "0978fd60-0ada-3608-926a-2cdb1dd559a0",
                                                "text": "The reigning monarch, King George VI, is commemorated by two express engines—G.W.R. \"King\" 4-6-0 No. 6028 and L.M.S.R. streamlined Pacific No. 6244—[…]."
